    {
      "text": "Risk-of-bias and applicability chart for three Truenat MTB Plus studies (Jose 2024, Sharma 2021, Sharma 2023). Jose 2024 is rated high risk for the reference standard; both Sharma studies are unclear for the reference standard in both risk of bias and applicability; all other domains are low.",
